    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d690">

                <pb facs="0617" n="541" xml:id="pg541"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/18073</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Representative Rodgers
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 7, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>72. For your information. Department just received following telegram from
                    American Consul, Piedras Negras: [Here follows telegram from Vice Consul Blocker
                    of May 7, 1916.]</p>
                <p>Bring same to attention <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> authorities and
                    impress upon them seriousness of incident, especially at this time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
